# StenoDesk Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# 1. WWW -> apex (canonical domain) â 301 permanent
https://www.stenodesk.co/* https://stenodesk.co/:splat 301!

# 2. SPA fallback: known client routes serve the SPA (spa.html = build copy of
#    index.html; proxying to /index.html directly triggers CF's automatic
#    /index.html -> / 308 canonicalization). Each public auth route serves its
#    OWN crawler-visible shell (signup.html etc.) so crawlers get a unique
#    title/description/canonical; /app and /portal stay on the SPA. Per-route
#    rules only â NOT a blanket /* rewrite â so genuinely unknown paths fall
#    through to 404.html.
/signup /signup 200
/founding /founding 200
/founding/ /founding 301
/signup/ /signup 301
/login /login 200
/login/ /login 301
/forgot-password /forgot-password 200
/forgot-password/ /forgot-password 301
/reset-password /reset-password 200
/reset-password/ /reset-password 301
/app/* /spa 200
/portal/* /spa 200

# 3. NOTE: cross-host www->apex redirect lives at the ZONE level (Page Rule
#    37503f8347cf5310daa793de118f334) â Pages _redirects cannot match a
#    different host than the deployment (verified empirically 2026-09-07).

